{
 "name": "Example: two passes on Anima",
 "title": {
  "zh": "两段放大",
  "en": "Two passes"
 },
 "version": {
  "zh": "Anima",
  "en": "Anima"
 },
 "family": "anima",
 "about": {
  "zh": "只用官方节点，什么都不用装：放大 1.22 倍，轻轻重绘（0.35）。没有 Tile 锁着，重绘再狠画面就跑了。要多张图就多跑几次，别调批次：Anima 的 VAE 会把一批图当成视频帧，第二段只剩一张。",
  "en": "ComfyUI's own nodes, nothing to install: enlarged 1.22x and redrawn gently (0.35). Nothing holds the picture, so a stronger redraw moves it. For several pictures run it several times, not a bigger batch: Anima's VAE takes a batch for video frames, and the second pass is left with one."
 },
 "ai": "A pass on Anima, then enlarged 1.22x and redrawn at denoise 0.35, nothing holding the picture: at 0.5 the shapes begin to move. open_workflow, set_model on its loader, then run_workflow with the prompt. For several pictures run it several times: Anima's VAE takes a batch for video frames, so a batch above 1 ends as one picture at the second pass.",
